flowchart TD
    title User Registration Flow

    A[Enter Name, Email, Password] --> B{All Fields Valid?}
    B -->|No| C[Show Validation Errors]
    B -->|Yes| D[Check Email Format]
    D --> E{Email Valid?}
    E -->|No| F[Show "Invalid Email"]
    E -->|Yes| G[Check Password Strength]
    G --> H{Strong Enough?}
    H -->|No| I[Show "Weak Password"]
    H -->|Yes| J[Check Email Availability]
    J --> K{Email Taken?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Show "Email Already Registered"]
    K -->|No| M[Hash Password]
    M --> N[Create User Record]
    N --> O[Send Welcome Email]
    O --> P[Return Success]
